      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 AEC. Publicado por Elsevier España, S.L.U. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography may be difficult in patients that have undergone Roux-en-Y gastric bypass. Due to the fact that prevalence of morbid obesity is increasing, and laparoscopic procedures for its treatment have increased, the incidence of biliary tract problems in patients of altered anatomy is also growing. We describe a laparoscopic technique to access the biliary tree by endoscope, through the excluded stomach."
      },
